Wow!  The ship's clock is working fine and looks real nice.  Better than new even!
Thanks.  You probably don't know when you were born but please bring me a box
showing me the time of your birth and I'll show you something neat.  Your Mom
or Dad might remember the exact time.  Your best guess will be fine.

Change the numbers
to show the time
you were born.

