UserPuzzle = off

Did you point to the hours timer in the first hole and type the hours part of
the time? So, for example, if you were born at 3:30 in the morning then type 3.
If you were born 10:45 at night then type 22 (12+10).

Did you point to the minutes timer in the second hole and type the minutes
part of the time?  For example, if you were born at 7:51 then type 51.

Try your best to get the time right but don't worry about being exact.

